# Seeded vocabulary

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-seeded-vocabulary/SKILL.md`. Origin rules: `docs/seeded-vocabulary.md` §1.1.

- Edit each domain’s `registry.go` (Source: `sourcevocab/`; Subject types: `subjecttypes/`; credibility grades: `sourcecredibilitygrades/`); no SQL seed INSERTs.
- Install only in `onboarding.createCatalog`. `OpenCatalog` / `catalogsession.Do` ensure user refs only — no vocab heal.
- `UNIQUE (key, origin)`; Lookup `(key, origin)`; FKs use vocabulary `id`.
- Delete types/fields when unused (`ErrInUse` while referenced).
